[{"answer":"Hello, Pembroke Cycling Holidays, Bob speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hello.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I've seen your advert for people to lead cycle trips.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you the right person to speak to?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I am.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Could I have your name, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/6.mp3"},{"answer":"It's Margaret Smith.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you looking for a permanent job, Margaret?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/8.mp3"},{"answer":"No, temporary.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/9.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got a permanent job starting in a few months' time,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/10.mp3"},{"answer":"and I want to do something else until then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/11.mp3"},{"answer":"What work do you do?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/12.mp3"},{"answer":"This will probably sound crazy - I used to be a lawyer,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/13.mp3"},{"answer":"and then I made a complete career change and I'm going to be a doctor.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I've just finished my training.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/15.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And have you had any experience of leading cycle trips?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I've led several bike tours in Africa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/18.mp3"},{"answer":"The trip to India that I had arranged to lead next month has now been cancelled,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/19.mp3"},{"answer":"so when I saw you were advertising for tour leaders, I decided to apply.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/20.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Now we normally have two or three leaders on a trip, depending on the size of the group.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Some tours are for very experienced cyclists,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/23.mp3"},{"answer":"but we've got a tour coming up soon in Spain,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/24.mp3"},{"answer":"which is proving so popular we need an additional leader.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/25.mp3"},{"answer":"It's a cycling holiday for families. Would that suit you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It certainly would.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/27.mp3"},{"answer":"I enjoy working with children,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and I probably need some more experience before I go on a really challenging trip.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/29.mp3"},{"answer":"That tour includes several teenagers;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/30.mp3"},{"answer":"have you worked with that age group before?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm a volunteer worker in a youth club,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/32.mp3"},{"answer":"where I help people to improve their cycling skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/33.mp3"},{"answer":"Before that I helped out in a cycling club where I taught beginners.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Well that's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Now the trip I mentioned is just for a fortnight,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/36.mp3"},{"answer":"but there might be the possibility of leading other tours after that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Would that fit in with your plans?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/38.mp3"},{"answer":"That'd be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/39.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be free for five months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/40.mp3"},{"answer":"My job is due to start on October the 2nd,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/41.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'm available from May the 1st until late September.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Now is there anything I need to know about the food you eat?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/44.mp3"},{"answer":"We usually have one or two people in the group who don't eat meat,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/45.mp3"},{"answer":"or have some sort of food allergy,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/46.mp3"},{"answer":"so we're always very careful about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I'm allergic to cheese.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Would that be a problem?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/49.mp3"},{"answer":"No, as long as we have enough notice, we can deal with that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/50.mp3"},{"answer":"That's great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/51.mp3"},{"answer":"It sounds really interesting!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Would you like me to fill in an application form?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, please.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Where should I post it to?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Could you send it to 27 Arbuthnot Place,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/56.mp3"},{"answer":"A-R-B-U-T-H-N-O-T - Place, Dumfries.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/57.mp3"},{"answer":"And what's the postcode, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/58.mp3"},{"answer":"DG7 4PH.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Was that P Papa or B Bravo?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/60.mp3"},{"answer":"P Papa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Got that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/62.mp3"},{"answer":"If you could return the application form by Friday this week, we can interview you on Tuesday next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Say half past two.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Would that be possible for you?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/66.mp3"},{"answer":"You're quite a long way from where I live, so I'll drive over on Monday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Should I bring anything to the interview?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/68.mp3"},{"answer":"We'll have your application form, of course,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/69.mp3"},{"answer":"but we'll need to see any certificates you've got that are relevant, in cycling, first aid, or whatever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/70.mp3"},{"answer":"OK.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/71.mp3"},{"answer":"And at the interview we'd like to find out about your experience of being a tour guide,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/72.mp3"},{"answer":"so could you prepare a 10 minute talk about that, please?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/73.mp3"},{"answer":"You don't need slides or any complicated equipment - just some notes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. I'll start thinking about that straightaway!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/76.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, we'll look forward to receiving your application form, and we'll contact you to confirm the interview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/77.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/78.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you, Margaret. Goodbye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/79.mp3"},{"answer":"Bye.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-12-test-4-part-1-2023-06-02-09-38-13/80.mp3"}]
